{"updated":"2026-11-05T07:07:02.591Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Joshua Wong, face of Hong Kong's pro-democracy protests, jailed for 10 years. Elsewhere, new Zealand braces for knife-edge election: What you need to know. And france braces for fresh protests in test for Macron's policies. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 0.4 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 4.3 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 5.3 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 30 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.0 near 207 km ESE of Sarangani, Philippines. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.3,0.36,0.41,0.44,0.49,0.53,0.57,0.6,0.65,0.67,0.72,0.85,0.96,1.14,1.42,1.53,1.58,1.61,1.64,1.7,1.72,1.74,1.76,1.81,1.86,1.93,2,2.04,2.08,2.11,2.16,2.19,2.23,2.29,2.33,2.38,2.42,2.46,2.51,2.55,2.6,2.65,2.71,2.77,2.84,2.96,3.08,3.23,3.25,3.29,3.32,3.38,3.42,3.48,3.6,3.69,3.76,3.83,3.88,3.94,3.97,4.03,4.08,4.1,4.12,4.17,4.19,4.21,4.24,4.28,4.33,4.41,4.47,4.55,4.62,4.68,4.74,4.78,4.84,4.87,4.93,5.05,5.2,5.38,5.89,5.97,6.08,6.13,6.19,6.26,6.35,6.43,6.48,6.63,6.69,6.77,6.94,7.12,7.19,7.3,7.36,7.42,7.45,7.49,7.51,7.56,7.59,7.66,7.71,7.73,7.79,7.83,7.92,7.96,8.02,8.07,8.09,8.15,8.21,8.28,8.36,8.42,8.46,8.52,8.58,8.66,8.72,8.78,8.82,8.89,8.97,9.04,9.09,9.15,9.23,9.31,9.44,9.5,9.58,9.67,9.75,9.87,9.94,10.03,10.09,10.15,10.21,10.23,10.27,10.31,10.34,10.38,10.44,10.53,10.65,10.72,10.76,10.84,10.9,10.98,11.13,11.31,11.91,12.03,12.09,12.14,12.2,12.24,12.29,12.33,12.39,12.5,12.53,12.65,12.74,12.78,12.8,12.85,12.89,12.93,12.98,13.04,13.08,13.11,13.13,13.19,13.23,13.29,13.36,13.44,13.56,13.61,13.66,13.7,13.73,13.77,13.83,13.87,13.92,13.9